  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="dbe83238-f984-5650-83a0-69fe21752a66" activityNameId="6ea45973-50b5-5b3e-a6ff-9e4db2183f41" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Printed wiring board, surface mounted, unspec., Pb free, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Printed wiring board, surface mounted, unspec., Pb free, at plant
The data represent an unspecified, surface-mounted, PWB , used in electronic devices. Material data are based on literature and own dismantling activities. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. An update was made in 2023, comprising: modification to energy consumption and regionalization of inventory flows, such as energy and metal input (Duque Ciceri et al., 2010; Kupka et al., 2018.); Geography: Data represent a global valuable example for a unspecified, surface mounted, PWB.; UUID: 16811c9b-2dc8-3bbf-9acf-2a7b255044b1
This dataset covers component input and production efforts (incl. PWB waste due to failure in mounting) for the production of an unspecified, surface mounted, PWB, using Pb-free solder material.
Location: Data represent a global valuable example for a unspecified, surface mounted, PWB.
Technology: average PWB mounting technology (solder paste production line)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_16811c9b-2dc8-3bbf-9acf-2a7b255044b1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
